    "Col Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages de Col"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Col adapts to your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Col s’adapte à votre Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Col follows the language of your Mac. If a word sounds wrong, you can fix it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Col suit la langue de votre Mac. Si un mot sonne faux, vous pouvez le corriger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Col never signs in to any AI service: it only hears the hooks each app calls on your Mac. Connecting adds Col’s hooks to the app’s settings and keeps a backup next to them. VS Code keeps Copilot permissions according to each session’s mode; other apps and scripts can report with colctl agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Col ne se connecte à aucun service d’IA : il entend seulement les hooks que chaque app appelle sur votre Mac. Relier une app ajoute les hooks de Col à ses réglages et garde une copie de sauvegarde à côté. VS Code garde les autorisations de Copilot selon le mode de chaque session ; les autres apps et vos scripts peuvent se signaler avec colctl agent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Col only watches the pointer over the notch, never anywhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Col ne regarde le pointeur qu’au-dessus de l’encoche, jamais ailleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Col speaks the new language after a restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Col parle la nouvelle langue après un redémarrage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It moves between pages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle passe d’une page à l’autre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It swells, then opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle gonfle, puis s’ouvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It swells, then opens. The delay is in Appearance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
