    "Lets Col take over the volume and brightness keys. Without it, macOS shows its own display too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à Col de prendre en charge les touches volume et luminosité. Sans elle, macOS affiche aussi le sien."
