    "What goes online": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui passe par Internet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What plays, the time, the song’s words and your next event, each when there is something to show.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui joue, l’heure, les paroles et votre prochain rendez-vous, chacun quand il a quelque chose à montrer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the closed island shows beside the camera.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que montre l’île fermée à côté de la caméra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the open island shows, page by page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que montre l’île ouverte, page par page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you copied, kept in memory only. Only the copies you pin are saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous avez copié, gardé en mémoire seulement. Seules les copies épinglées sont enregistrées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When several things run": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand plusieurs choses tournent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you plug in, and at 20 % and 10 %.": {
