    "Writing an extension": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrire une extension"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos IA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your AI apps and your models, at a glance": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos apps IA et vos modèles, d’un coup d’œil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your AI apps in the notch: their sessions, their requests, their state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos apps IA dans l’encoche : leurs sessions, leurs demandes, leur état."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your AirPods and headphones, with their battery, as they connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos AirPods et écouteurs, avec leur batterie, dès qu’ils se connectent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Souffleur scripts are here: the text comes out of the notch, right under the camera, at the pace of your voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos scripts de Souffleur sont là : le texte sort de l’encoche, juste sous la caméra, au rythme de votre voix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your island": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre île"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your next events and today’s reminders": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos prochains événements et les rappels du jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your next events beside the clock, and a button to join a call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos prochains rendez-vous à côté de l’horloge, et un bouton pour rejoindre un appel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your next events beside the clock, and a button to join a call. Col needs your calendars for that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos prochains rendez-vous à côté de l’horloge, et un bouton pour rejoindre un appel. Col a besoin de vos calendriers pour cela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your next events, right here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos prochains événements, ici même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own island, drawn by Col on your wallpaper with what it shows right now. It opens and closes like the one in the notch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre île, dessinée par Col sur votre fond d’écran avec ce qu’elle montre en ce moment. Elle s’ouvre et se ferme comme celle de l’encoche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own lyrics": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos propres paroles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your pages, with what is really happening on your Mac. Pick one to see it; hover the island to try it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos pages, avec ce qui se passe vraiment sur votre Mac. Choisissez-en une pour la voir ; survolez l’île pour l’essayer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone must be on the same network. Only a phone that scanned this code can drive the prompter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre téléphone doit être sur le même réseau. Seul un téléphone qui a scanné ce code peut piloter le prompteur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your question goes only to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre question part uniquement vers %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recent copies": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos dernières copies"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recent copies land here. They stay in memory; only the ones you pin are saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos dernières copies arrivent ici. Elles restent en mémoire ; seules celles que vous épinglez sont enregistrées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your script under the camera, at the pace of your voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre script sous la caméra, au rythme de votre voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your script under the camera, at the pace of your voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre script sous la caméra, au rythme de votre voix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your voice is heard on your Mac and never recorded. The recognizer is given the words of your script, so names and jargon are heard right.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre voix est entendue sur votre Mac et jamais enregistrée. La reconnaissance reçoit les mots de votre script : les noms propres et le jargon sont bien compris."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout est prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réduire/agrandir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "free": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "libres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” by %@ is playing: the island shows it with its cover, and its controls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« %@ » de %@ est en lecture : l’île l’affiche avec sa pochette et ses commandes."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
